{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:InformationTheory.PolynomialObservableSubcategory","@type":"LeanModule","name":"InformationTheory.PolynomialObservableSubcategory","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Set.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.Basic"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PvsNPBoundary.mem_polynomialObservableSubcategory","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PvsNPBoundary.mem_polynomialObservableSubcategory","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/polynomial-observable-subcategory.lean#L36-L43","doc":"Membership in R° is exactly the non-vanishing of the\npolynomial-time degree-0 section space. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PvsNPBoundary.polynomialObservableSubcategory","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PvsNPBoundary.polynomialObservableSubcategory","kind":"def","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/polynomial-observable-subcategory.lean#L24-L34","doc":"**Polynomial observable subcategory** R°(L, q).\n\nThe set of resolution-tree nodes `x` whose polynomial-time\ndegree-0 section space `Γ_poly(x)` is non-trivial — i.e. the\nnodes from which the degree-0 answer is computable in at most\n`polyBound` Planck steps.  Modelled as the subset of nodes for\nwhich a non-vanishing predicate `gammaPolyNonzero` holds. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:polynomial-observable-subcategory","label":"def:polynomial-observable-subcategory","md":"quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/polynomial-observable-subcategory.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PvsNPBoundary.TreeNode","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PvsNPBoundary.TreeNode","kind":"def","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/polynomial-observable-subcategory.lean#L21-L22","doc":"A node of the resolution tree, abstracted as its index. ","signatureChunk":0}]}